[TITLE]
AquaOptima dPHM-PINN Sprint 12 — small reference EPANET .inp fixture
with a HEAD-curve pump. Three-node topology:

    R1 (suction reservoir, fixed head 5 m)
      |
      +-- PU1 (pump, HEAD curve PUMPCURVE1) --> J1
                                                |
                                                +-- P1 (pipe) --> J2 (15 L/s consumer)

Quadratic pump curve fit yields ``H(Q) = 45 - 800 Q^2`` at s=1, in
m^3/s. SI flow units (LPS), Hazen-Williams head loss. Solvable by
aquaoptima.dphm.newton_solve with jacobian_mode="analytic".

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev   Demand   Pattern
 J1   0.0     0.0     ;     ; pump discharge node (no consumer)
 J2   0.0    15.0     ;     ; 15 L/s consumer

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head   Pattern
 R1    5.0   ;          ; 5 m fixed-head suction reservoir

[PIPES]
;ID   Node1   Node2   Length   Diameter   Roughness   MinorLoss   Status
 P1   J1      J2      200.0    150.0      130.0       0.0         OPEN

[PUMPS]
;ID    Node1   Node2   Parameters
 PU1   R1      J1      HEAD   PUMPCURVE1

[CURVES]
;ID          X-Value   Y-Value
 PUMPCURVE1   0.0      45.00
 PUMPCURVE1  10.0      44.92
 PUMPCURVE1  20.0      44.68
 PUMPCURVE1  30.0      44.28
 PUMPCURVE1  40.0      43.72
 PUMPCURVE1  50.0      43.00

[OPTIONS]
 Units                LPS
 Headloss             H-W

[END]
